    "name": "gameops-chatbot-golden-v3",
    "description": "40-item golden dataset: 10 multi-hop FAQ RAG cases (documents-grounded), 10 payment (DB fixture-grounded), 10 bug, 10 voc. reference_answer is actual text, not rubric. Paper basis: RAGAS, StructGPT, ChatLR, Few-shot Text-to-SQL.",
    "version": "v3",
    "total_examples": 40,
    "categories": {
      "faq": 10,
      "payment": 10,
      "bug": 10,
      "voc": 10
    },
    "paper_basis": [
      "RAGAS: Automated Evaluation of Retrieval Augmented Generation (EACL 2024)",
      "StructGPT: A General Framework for LLM to Reason over Structured Data (2023)",
      "ChatLR: Redefining Information Retrieval of Structured Database via LLMs (2025)",
      "Enhancing Few-shot Text-to-SQL Capabilities of LLMs (2023)"
    ],
    "design_notes": {
      "faq": "Multi-hop RAG examples grounded in actual documents table content. Each FAQ item requires combining at least two evidence claims, while remaining distinct from ragas-v1.json 15 items.",
      "payment": "DB fixture from actual payments/refunds/item_delivery_logs/gacha_logs. reference_answer reflects expected chatbot output given fixture counts per StructGPT/ChatLR structured reading.",
